    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79671" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παροδ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of a</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάροδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					111.2
				</span></i>
			, Arg.<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
			</span></i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				54
			</span></i> ; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρόδῳ χρώμενος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Astron., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἀποκατάστασις</span> restoration <i>of a
				transit</i>, i. e. complete revolution, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Hyp.</u>
				1.30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>transient, brief</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδημία</span> Vett. Val. <i><span class="en">
				98.26
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
			<i>in passing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				171.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pall.
			</span></i>
			<i>in Hp. Fract.</i><i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Astrol.,
				<i>according to chronocratory</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ γένεσιν</span>, Vett. Val. <i><span class="en">
				100.29
			</span></i>. Adv.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				26
			</span></i>.</div>
